### BOOKS

### Get all books
GET http://localhost:3000/books

### Get book by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/books/b1

### Create book
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "b4",
  "authorId": "a1",
  "title": "New Book",
  "publicationDate": "2026-01-01"
}

### Update book
PUT http://localhost:3000/books/b4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "authorId": "a1",
  "title": "Updated Book",
  "publicationDate": "2026-02-01"
}

### Delete book
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/b4




